<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Maseca raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Maseca raised.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Flemings raised Mexican corn-flour maker Maseca SA to a long-term buy from a hold rating, the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>Analyst Kevin Kirkeby said Maseca's share price has already taken into account a risk premium representing the uncertainty as to when the government will raise its imposed cieling on corn flour.</p>
<p>&quot;Our belief that a full lifting of corn flour quotas will occur in 1Q 1998 prompts a recommendation upgrade,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
